WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.450
Manon recovers as Ryu falls from heavy Rond-point in the corner.

2
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:01.050
Standing heavy punch whiffs while Ryu is still getting up.

3
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:01.950
Heavy Manège Doré catches Ryu after the whiffed heavy punch.

4
